Folio bundles code derived from other open-source projects.

Mihon / Tachiyomi (https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon, https://github.com/tachiyomiorg/tachiyomi)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The manga extension source API (app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/), the chapter
recognition/sanitizer logic, and the Cloudflare interceptor are adapted from Mihon/Tachiyomi so
that Folio can load the same extension APKs. The package names under eu.kanade.tachiyomi are kept
unchanged on purpose: extensions are compiled against those exact class names.

